<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 300 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 300 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 300 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    600 MLN    600 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    =	    300 MLN    =	    =</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 2 BANK BILLS   =	     300 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-15/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
